# =========================================================
# IMPORTANT SOFTWARE ENGINEERING NOTES
# =========================================================
#
# Separation of Concerns
# ----------------------
# API logic should eventually move into:
#
# services/
#
# Visualization logic into:
#
# utils/
#
# UI logic remains inside Streamlit pages.
#
#
# Clean Architecture Goal
# -----------------------
#
# app.py
#     UI + routing
#
# services/
#     API/data logic
#
# pages/
#     multipage views
#
# utils/
#     helper functions + visualizations
#
